general.  Try not to eat acid things unless you have many hp's.
Otherwise, with your intrinsic poison resistance, you can pretty much
chow down on anything!  But I wouldn't eat your little kitty, no
matter how annoying it gets, unless you're ready to deal with
intrinsic aggravate monsters.

